[1059-qd-dhag-2020-09-29.pdf] - [Điều 10.] 
 Phan loai ket qua ren luyen
1. Két qua ren luyen dugc phan thanh cac loai: Xuat sac, Tot, Kha, Trung binh,
Yéu. Sinh vien co ket qua ren luyen xep loai tur Trung binh tro len la dat.
2. Phan loai ket qua ren luyen:
a) Tu 90 dén 100 diem: loai Xuat sac;
b) Tu 80 den duroi 90 diém: loai Tot:
c) Tu 65 dén duroi 80 diém: loai Kha;
d) Tur 50 dén duroi 65 diém: loai Trung binh;
e) Duroi 50 diém: loai Yéu.

